ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Hoy tengo el día inquieto.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Tengo ganas de comprar
herramientas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} montar muebles{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
y levantar vallas.
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}¡Pero ya tengo en casa quince
destornilladores y siete martillos!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}¡Detenme!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Mannomann, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}was mach ich nur?!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ich will alles kaufen, aber ich hab
alles hier schon mehrfach zu Hause!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Resistirse no tiene sentido!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}La tienda de bricolaje me atrae
como la miel a las moscas{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

EN:
Whenever I'm in the home center,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
I have so much fun that I lose track
of time.

TRANSLATION:
Yapı Market'e ne zaman girsem,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
öyle eğleniyorum ki zamanın nasıl
geçtiğini unutuyorum.
